  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 310.05 Research and Development Facility Permit Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 310.05 Research and Development Facility Permit Fee. The fee for a research and development facility permit application shall be calculated in accordance with the equation given in Env-Sw 310.02 using the following substitute values:\n\n(a) The MBF shall equal $1,000; and\n\n(b) The CF shall be determined from Table 310-II based on the total quantity of waste the project involves instead of the daily capacity of the facility.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw300.html"
